<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;KEKKAISHI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kekkaishi is a Japanese anime television series that falls under the genre of adventure anime and manga, focusing on the story of two high school students, Yoshimori Sumimura and Tokine Yukimura, who protect their school from evil spirits."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YOSHIMORI SUMIMURA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yoshimori Sumimura is one of the main characters in Kekkaishi, a high school student who is a kekkaishi and is serious and protective."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOKINE YUKIMURA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tokine Yukimura is one of the main characters in Kekkaishi, a high school student who is a kekkaishi and is adventurous and protective."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KARASUMORI ACADEMY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Karasumori Academy is the setting of Kekkaishi, a school where Yoshimori Sumimura and Tokine Yukimura attend and protect from evil spirits."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AYAKASHI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ayakashi are evil spirits that pose a threat to the characters in Kekkaishi, requiring protection and combat from the kekkaishi."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ayakashi are supernatural beings that were vanquished during the night, creating a sense of chaos and danger that Yoshimori protected Tokine from."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADVENTURE ANIME AND MANGA GENRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Adventure anime and manga genre is characterized by epic journeys, quests, and missions, often with fantastical or speculative elements, which is the genre of Kekkaishi."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YELLOW TANABE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yellow Tanabe is the creator of Kekkaishi, an anime and manga series."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUPERNATURAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Supernatural elements are a key feature of Kekkaishi, involving evil spirits and magical abilities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ACTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Action is a characteristic element of Kekkaishi, featuring fast-paced battles and thrilling sequences."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMEDY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Comedy is a characteristic element of Kekkaishi, adding lighthearted moments and humor to the series."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FANTASY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fantasy elements are a key feature of Kekkaishi, involving magical abilities and supernatural beings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EPIC JOURNEYS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Epic journeys are a characteristic element of the adventure anime and manga genre, which Kekkaishi belongs to."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THRILLING PLOT TWISTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Thrilling plot twists are a characteristic element of the adventure anime and manga genre, which Kekkaishi belongs to."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEROIC PROTAGONISTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Heroic protagonists are a key feature of the adventure anime and manga genre, which Kekkaishi belongs to."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FAST-PACED ACTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fast-paced action is a characteristic element of the adventure anime and manga genre, which Kekkaishi belongs to."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FULL MOON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Full moon is a significant element in the text, affecting the behavior of spirits and creating a sense of tension."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MOONLIGHT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Moonlight is a significant element in the text, enhancing the atmosphere and visibility during nighttime patrols."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SPIRIT WHISPERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Spirit whispers are a significant element in the text, indicating the presence of spirits and creating an eerie atmosphere."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SACRED TREE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sacred tree is a significant location in the text, serving as a beacon and a source of energy for the characters."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EVIL SPIRITS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Evil spirits are a significant element in the text, posing a constant threat to the characters and requiring their protection."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROTECTIVE PRESENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Protective presence is a significant element in the text, describing how Yoshimori's presence gives Tokine a sense of security and calm."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DROWNING IN THEIR DEPTHS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Drowning in their depths is a significant element in the text, describing the intense connection between Yoshimori and Tokine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADRENALINE RUSH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Adrenaline rush is a significant element in the text, describing the excitement and thrill of battling ayakashi."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONNECTION BEYOND FRIENDSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Connection beyond friendship is a significant element in the text, describing the deeper feelings between Yoshimori and Tokine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRUST AND PARTNERSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trust and partnership are significant elements in the text, describing the bond between Yoshimori and Tokine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTENSE BATTLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Intense battle is a significant event in the text, describing the fight against ayakashi and the sense of calm it brings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VANQUISHED AYAKASHI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vanquished ayakashi is a significant event in the text, marking the successful completion of a mission."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PANG OF LONGING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pang of longing is a significant element in the text, describing Tokine's feelings towards Yoshimori."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DARE NOT VOICE ALOUD&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dare not voice aloud is a significant element in the text, describing Tokine's hesitation to express her feelings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YOSHIMORI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yoshimori is a character whose presence provides protection and whose strong and angular features, along with his intense gaze, evoke a sense of connection in Tokine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOKINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tokine is a character who feels a deep connection and longing towards Yoshimori, experiencing a sense of protection in his presence."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NIGHT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The night is the setting during which the events take place, including the vanquishing of ayakashi and the development of Tokine's feelings towards Yoshimori."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MOON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The moon is mentioned as providing light against which Yoshimori's profile is etched, enhancing his appearance and the scene."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0081</data>
    </node>
